      "side": 1,
      "message": "For external formats, this is required to be Optimal, https://registry.khronos.org/vulkan/specs/1.1-extensions/html/vkspec.html#VUID-VkImageCreateInfo-pNext-02398.\n\nFor AHB that have a known vulkan format (not external), I don\u0027t see anything that explicitly says they have to optimal tiling, but I also don\u0027t see anyway for someone to query such a thing from the AHB. FWIW I think Dawn also always sets OPTIMAL when importing AHBs.\n\nSo I think for now we shouldn\u0027t plan on letting the caller pass in a tiling and just assume it will be optimal. You can update the comment here though to reflect what I said above.",
